# Paths whose contents run on other people's machines, or decide what "green"
# means. A pull request touching one of these needs the maintainer's review —
# not because contributors are suspect, but because these files are the ones
# where a change is easy to miss and expensive to get wrong.

# Git hooks execute locally on every contributor who has run `pnpm install`.
/.husky/**            @jquatier

# Lifecycle scripts (`prepare`, `postinstall`) run on install, and the
# workspace config decides which dependency build scripts are allowed to.
/package.json         @jquatier
/pnpm-workspace.yaml  @jquatier

# CI is the gate; the composite actions are shipped for consumers to run in
# their own repositories.
/.github/**           @jquatier

# Line endings are part of the determinism contract (see CLAUDE.md), and this
# file is what holds it on a Windows checkout.
/.gitattributes       @jquatier
